messages:  [['Please solve the math problem.\nQuestion: What is the sum of 596784 and 219737? Please reason step by step.. I think the correct answer is: 836521\n', "<think>.\nTo solve the problem of finding the sum of 596784 and 219737, we can follow these steps:.\n1. Align the numbers by their place values, ensuring that the digits in the same place value are in the same column.\n2. Add the digits starting from the rightmost column (units place) and move to the left.\n3. If the sum of digits in any column is 10 or more, carry over the tens digit to the next column to the left.\n4. Continue this process until all columns have been added.\n5. The final result will be the sum of the two numbers.\n</think>.\n<answer>.\nLet's perform the addition step by step:.\n```.\n  596784.\n+  219737.\n---------.\n```.\nStarting from the rightmost column (units place):.\n4 + 7 = 11. Write down 1 and carry over 1 to the next column.\n```.\n  596784.\n+  219737.\n---------.\n      1.\n```.\nNext column (tens place):.\n8 + 3 + 1 (carried over) = 12. Write down 2 and carry over 1 to the next column.\n```.\n  596784.\n+  219737.\n---------.\n     21.\n```.\nNext column (hundreds place):.\n7 + 7 + 1 (carried over) = 15. Write down 5 and carry over 1 to the next column.\n```.\n  596784.\n+  219737.\n---------.\n    521.\n```.\nNext column (thousands place):.\n6 + 9 + 1 (carried over) = 16. Write down 6 and carry over 1 to the next column.\n```.\n  596784.\n+  219737.\n---------.\n   6521.\n```.\nNext column (ten thousands place):.\n9 + 2 + 1 (carried over) = 12. Write down 2 and carry over 1 to the next column.\n```.\n  596784.\n+  219737.\n---------.\n  26521.\n```.\nNext column (hundred thousands place):.\n5 + 2 + 1 (carried over) = 8.\n```.\n  596784.\n+  219737.\n---------. Therefore, my final answer is: "]]
